OL,3,GNEWSACity set to scrap two-hour free
OL,4,Aparking
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hours' free parking could be
OL,7,Fscrapped across Wakefield under new
OL,8,Fproposals from councillors.
OL,10,FThe change, set to be decided on 20
OL,11,FOctober, would also see changes in
OL,12,Fresident permit charges and increased
OL,13,Fon-street parking fees with a free
OL,14,F30-minute period, along with the launch
OL,15,Fof a consultation on a #1 evening
OL,16,Fparking rate.
OL,18,FA review found that the changes, if
OL,19,Fapplied across the borough, would raise
OL,20,Fmore than #1.8m for Wakefield Council.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
